    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "过场动画和预告",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》兹白角色PV——「亦如陌上尘」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/24/326985891/59dc2bb9c5a00c7c8b68ae9912ebcb74_4961670517919716197.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年1月28日</color>\n据卢氏族志所记，先人行于月下林间，偶得仙人轶事。\n或真亦或伪？飘如陌上尘。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=jrDDQ1l3R3A"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》角色预告-「兹白：常身归于世」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/24/326985891/6ed13b1679a2fe02b508851f14d98241_7841724646516653055.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年2月2日</color>\n三尸出鬼，俱生俱灭。\n以日为年，以此明心。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=PuI3bYK5UAk"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》剧情PV-「古日魇」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/24/326985891/686b693ee2499b778865e1fb5633feab_3061315039479212168.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年2月4日</color>\n夙昔皆远去，徒我滞流连。\n梦魂难终忘，犹在天地间。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=D8cOwJWXyOE"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》剧情PV-「云间月」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/24/326985891/e993a07f9eb9bcf2cd39627c708fdc95_3250155688744120839.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年2月4日</color>\n岁聿云暮苍山远，万里霄彩寄东风。\n白驹行过春草色，祈我明月照众生。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=FUtjF6ezt3I"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "展示页和表情包",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》派蒙的画作47-表情包登场！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/24/326985891/3e53624b24f53d7e2f7c42b92b747558_624889732769340301.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年1月20日</color>\n旅行者大家好！最新的《原神》表情包于HoYoLAB上线了！\n派蒙的画作囊括了《原神》里众多角色的Q版本表情包，希望大家喜欢，今后派蒙仍会努力画出让大家喜爱的作品！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/24/326985891/b79785ae43296825cd96c0b1dcc04461_8331323540782825170.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/03/35428890/532e6df1ada047a38f693b8965a5686c_9074386260100939260.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/24/326985891/5b533f2a8dbaf4ae923ef5ff04a4030a_1693165660157928494.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/24/326985891/b0681df9a1e67c34e47c99b617eb78d6_6458733702009912015.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "白驹过隙——兹白角色轶事"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/24/326985891/2ef6fe1d75b3e4322beeef54817c6ea2_8465588356576040126.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年1月25日</color>\n旅途中，那些亦真亦假的传说，或许曾为旅行者拼凑出「白马仙人」的模糊身影。当海灯明霄再亮起，这位只存在于故事中的仙人，或许会现身故土吗？"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "仙人的日常竟是…——兹白趣味漫画"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/24/326985891/9e3578159cb6e4cd195bb23caf48021d_6958703131394389294.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年2月7日</color>\n海灯节刚过，兹白也渐渐融入了璃月的生活…快来看看最近她都在做些什么吧~"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "来年春雨守时，夏阳和煦，秋霜不欺秧苗…"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/24/35428890/8fa2f8cfe932935ad08d1063de2b1378_4077428649170691482.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年2月16日</color>\n瞧那些小人儿，给门楣挂桃符，在街坊放霄灯，倒真把璃月港装点成个亮闪闪的宝匣了。哦？要我也说两句吉祥话？人间庆贺新年的传统，还真是千百年未变。那便祝——来年春雨守时，夏阳和煦，秋霜不欺秧苗…待到下回瑞雪覆檐时，仍能见到今日璃月的万家灯火。"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物关系"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7083,
        "name": "天使",
        "desc": "<p>它们也被称为天上的使者，主要职责是帮助人类。后来它们被逐出天空岛，最终失去了形体与心智。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/17/326985891/2aa6b47bf4316be4c736d48e07f765e4_7709871144929088989.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "兹白是",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4897,
        "name": "天理",
        "desc": "<p>第一位降临者，击败了世间的七位龙王，并创造了人类。原初的那一位或许便是法涅斯。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/07/326985891/513d51e0ebfd54f5da34a9f85dfaf61f_3593056138001658182.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "所创造的天使之一。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7625,
        "name": "三月女神",
        "desc": "<p>艾莉亚、桑娜妲与卡侬——是三位姐妹，也是曾经统治苍穹的月神。哥伦比娅·希珀塞莱尼娅是在三月女神陨落数千年后诞生的月神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/08/02/317661877/1f76253cb02cf46c0f6d8b836271b6f2_1336603059689273640.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "兹白被任命为月使，并获赐月之轮。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9037,
        "name": "图特",
        "desc": "<p>鹮之王是赤王的七柱之一，是众书记之书记。图特代表了赤王最为智慧的一面，奉王之命发明了沙漠文字与魔法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/06/22/326985891/348c5d2cc1cf42730c6eb76c79aa8b4f_1433791600021894332.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "是她的同僚。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9355,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "兹白是琅玕古文明的高天使者。人们将她尊奉为社稷神。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9095,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在「葬火之战」期间，天理决意净化这片受污染的土地，向人类文明降下了寒天之钉。兹白违抗了她的创造者，阻拦了灵石，使得部分人们得以逃脱。他们向北部迁徙，最终在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5118,
        "name": "沉玉谷",
        "desc": "<p>伴随着轻柔的微风，馥郁的茶香再度飘遍璃月的高原。</p><p>「茗生此中石，玉泉流不歇。」清微淡远的芬芳与古时的玉玦歌一同拂过翘英庄的河川，直至熙来攘往的遗珑埠。南方雾气氤氲的山岭间，不知又隐藏着什么样的奇遇…</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/04/15/142453215/c3b05f550a4a993a64548c995c9ab98c_8667469311642788970.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "找到了容身之所。兹白也因此陨落了。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4898,
        "name": "伊斯塔露",
        "desc": "<p>时之执政，又名为常世大神、「千风之神」，和卡伊洛斯，「不变世界的统领与执政」。她是原初的那一位影子之一。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/07/326985891/6c6230d12f0386d6d86e680bd88d4398_8454218153591000583.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在兹白死去的前一刻，时之执政凝固了她三个破碎的灵魂本源，并将它们分别置于天使的三尸神体内。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7469,
        "name": "摩拉克斯",
        "desc": "<p>璃月的岩神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/06/317661877/51993b7b69c68f3d8388ed314bf1eed8_7574517325605995001.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "兹白的老朋友，教了她斩三尸。在她死后的六千年，摩拉克斯复活了她。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5102,
        "name": "仙人",
        "desc": "<p>仙人是一群生活在提瓦特的不朽之物，千年来一直保护着璃月的人们。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/03/09/288375639/acf8b3f376f436b47bd1c4911fb9fe4d_8502257663901947323.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "虽然兹白拥有仙人的称号，但这并非仙人的统治者授予，而是由人民授予的。\n兹踞\n兹踬\n兹蹻\n兹白的三尸神。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
